                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00001         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract logo_tick profile=presentation: Advance the shared logo phase on Attract and High Score; High Score also advances its timer. When the phase changes, redraw changing logo tiles on BACK if publication is idle. Cache the active screen's generated Tiled root when the screen changes; add each shared root-relative offset to form a tile destination.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00002         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract logo_vbord_clock profile=presentation: Advance the shared attract and high-score logo phase from an IRQ-atomic VBLANK sample.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00003         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract menu_paint_rows profile=presentation: Draw authored menu labels using green for the selected row and grey for remaining rows.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00004         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract menu_tick profile=presentation: Dispatch Attract input and both High Score returns; advance the shared 558-tick High Score interval after initial publication, consuming input without gameplay mutation.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00005         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract menu_updated profile=presentation: Paint current menu fields on the prepared BACK owner, retire its dirty bit and publish through the existing framebuffer callback.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00006         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract menu_scan profile=presentation: Scan input and route safe automatic-loop wake while preserving local menu edges.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00007         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract menu_load_finish profile=presentation: Paint authored menu rows; Options keeps selector brackets, while high-score selection changes text colour only.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00008         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract highscore_commit_name profile=presentation: Highscore commit name.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00009         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract highscore_prepare_name profile=presentation: Highscore prepare name.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00010         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract stage_player_score profile=presentation: Draw zero for a fresh game or current packed-BCD score during hidden level-start hydration.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00011         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract stage_panel_char profile=presentation: Stage panel char.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00012         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract presentation_panel_slice profile=presentation: Dispatch helper slices to the TOP redraw or the High Score logo slice; leave unrelated slices and screens unchanged.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00013         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract stage_panel_read_letters profile=copy: Preserve IRQ and PAR4 around the resident copy of the three active letter variants; return U=$C2 and B=3.
                      (rc/demo_runtime.s):00014         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract stage_panel_text profile=presentation: Stage panel text.
