                      (_text_ranking.inc):00102         ; Page-$23 high-score helper.  It remains mapped only while the low-RAM
                      (_text_ranking.inc):00103         ; high-score owner calls it.  All calls that may change PAR5 return through
                      (_text_ranking.inc):00104         ; presentation_page24_resume in resident code.
